    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc01_0060_bbteacher_01",
      "hash64": "1AA7091CDEC92008",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，謝謝[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳幫忙傳話。\\n那位同學現在已經好多了。[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc01_0060_caretaker_02",
      "hash64": "010965663D1CD793",
      "text": "好的，大家～\\n這裡就是居民會館！[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc01_0060_caretaker_03",
      "hash64": "010964663D1CD5E0",
      "text": "也就是接下來這段期間\\n大家要住宿的設施。[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc01_0060_caretaker_04",
      "hash64": "01096B663D1CE1C5",
      "text": "照計畫來說，藍莓學園的學生\\n也會一起在這裡住宿！\\r\\n……原本應該是那樣的！[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc01_0060_caretaker_05",
      "hash64": "01096A663D1CE012",
      "text": "但現在改為由橘子學院的學生\\n單獨住宿在這裡了。[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc01_0060_caretaker_06",
      "hash64": "010969663D1CDE5F",
      "text": "但現在改為由葡萄學院的學生\\n單獨住宿在這裡了。[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc01_0060_bbteacher_02",
      "hash64": "1AA70C1CDEC92521",
      "text": "……因為這個村子就是\\n那些孩子們的故鄉嘛。[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc01_0060_caretaker_07",
      "hash64": "010968663D1CDCAC",
      "text": "那麼，來吧，\\n請進請進。[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
